# Belt-and-braces for the tiny rootfs: drop portage from the @system set so
# no dependency calculation can ever pull it into the target. xstage never
# emerges portage into the rootfs anyway (explicit package list, --root-deps=
# rdeps, --oneshot) — this file only takes effect if you point
# PORTAGE_CONFIGROOT at a config stack that includes this profile dir
# (see genstage/readme.md, "No portage on the target").
-*sys-apps/portage
